    <unit id="ApiEventClosed">
      <segment>
        <source>Raised when the close action is clicked.</source>
        <target state="translated">點擊關閉操作時觸發。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="BasicDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Usage of basic Tag, and it could be IsClosable and customize close button by set closeIcon property,will display default close button when closeIcon is setting to true. IsClosable Tag supports onClose events.</source>
        <target state="translated">基礎 Tag 用法。可通過 IsClosable 設置為可關閉，並通過 closeIcon 屬性自定義關閉按鈕；closeIcon 設置為 true 時顯示默認關閉按鈕。IsClosable Tag 支持 onClose 事件。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="BasicTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Basic</source>
        <target state="translated">基礎用法</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="CheckableTagDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>CheckableTag works like Checkbox. CheckableTagGroup provides single and multiple selection over a shared option set.</source>
        <target state="translated">CheckableTag 提供類似 Checkbox 的切換效果，CheckableTagGroup 可在同組選項上進行單選或多選。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
