    <unit id="SemanticTagCloseDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Close entry raising the Closed event with a small close icon</source>
        <target state="translated">關閉入口，觸發 Closed 事件並顯示小型關閉圖示。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticTagContentDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Content text area with line height and inline padding</source>
        <target state="translated">文本內容區域，行高與內聯內邊距。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticTagIconDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Icon area sized by the tag icon token and colored by the root foreground</source>
        <target state="translated">圖示區域，尺寸來自 Tag 圖示 Token，顏色跟隨根前景。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticTagRootDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Root element of the tag carrying color, variant, content and the close entry</source>
        <target state="translated">Tag 根元素，承載顏色、Variant、內容與關閉入口。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="StatusTagDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>We preset five different colors, you can set color property such as success,processing,error,default and warning to indicate specific status.</source>
        <target state="translated">預設了五種不同顏色，可以設置 success、processing、error、default 和 warning 等 color 屬性表示具體狀態。</target>
